  "note": "the lot is the plot's own floor under the kit's floors: the deck tile (Base_Deck_Color.png), its Texture's Color3 at `lot`. It shows only as the last 8 studs under the back wall, the darker foot of that wall (the Kept and Tower overlays take it too, unmarked). The ground is the slab between plots, a flat colour, lifted from #1A1D2E for AR20's C so the open ground beside the crossing isn't black with no haze over it. The Strip and the side street wear the Strip's own paving tile (build/handoff/Strip/maps/Strip_Paving_Color.png, Lantern Row's lifted): stepping off the stones onto the plates is coming home."
